Aura — Hear the Light · Glass Product Render demo · LemoLab × Claude Opus 5.5

All 3D models, materials, lighting, caustics, typography layout and animation: generated in code (three.js) for this film. Product, brand name and design are fictional.
Music: original composition, synthesized from scratch with numpy (music/score.py). No samples.
Sound effects: synthesized (mix.py, core/audio/sfx.py).

